title: 'Dimensions S1.0 merged: the board engine runs under the unchanged CSP in four engines'
summary: 'PR #99 merged into feat/gnomon-dimensions with all ten CI jobs green. A lazy Excalidraw 0.18.1 board chunk ships inside the Gnomon GUI''s pinned tree, loads and draws with zero CSP refusals in Chrome, Edge, Firefox and WKWebView, and cannot be reached from the shipped app until the S1.1 reskin. One build round, one review round (Aegis, Judge, Probe, Mika), one fix round.'
